{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASH AND DIE</strong> is a first-person horror game where you take photos of houses for a real estate agency. They\u2019ve decided to try something new and unusual \u2013 night shots of their listings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/0c04207a3274d4740798a1643d300b0e.webp?t=1768927410\" width=570 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to capture the rooms on your checklist and get the perfect shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/f1404cc65b2da588dbf8a75a981fc09c.poster.avif?t=1768927410\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/f1404cc65b2da588dbf8a75a981fc09c.webm?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/f1404cc65b2da588dbf8a75a981fc09c.mp4?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/33f9b3a1f627d15cd74fbaf56348d5cd.webp?t=1768927410\" width=176 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through dark hallways and rooms to find the best angles for your photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/ef4d7a648a33dc34de6a72bc28ead094.poster.avif?t=1768927410\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/ef4d7a648a33dc34de6a72bc28ead094.webm?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/ef4d7a648a33dc34de6a72bc28ead094.mp4?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/ac8c6516f15bd41eba9093630e465809.webp?t=1768927410\" width=400 height=43 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is still inside. Finish your job or never leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/cf2bfc000c94a0a7cd8dc7308b898a36.poster.avif?t=1768927410\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/cf2bfc000c94a0a7cd8dc7308b898a36.webm?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/cf2bfc000c94a0a7cd8dc7308b898a36.mp4?t=1768927410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to snap night-time photos of each property while navigating dark, eerie rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every door is open. Explore what\u2019s accessible, but be ready for the unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the perfect shot while staying alive. Every click could put you in danger.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in tense, atmospheric environments with unpredictable threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http